---
/**
 * Site wallpaper — a single fixed gradient layer behind every transparent
 * section. Sections with a solid fill (`bg-page`, `bg-card`, ...) cover it.
 * Colors come from `brand.colors.gradientFrom` / `gradientTo`.
 */
---

<div
  class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10 bg-green-wash"
  aria-hidden="true"
></div>
